---
// Hitbox area panel for the 3D model viewer. src/scripts/model_viewer switches
// the camera from #hitbox-mode-buttons (3D / flat 2D) and #hitbox-view-buttons
// (the side to look from; none pressed at a custom 3D angle), and renders one
// card per health pool into #hitbox-area-pools (area_panel.ts). While comparing builds it also fills
// #hitbox-compare: the headline, the metric switch and the diff legend (whose
// swatches index.ts colors from DIFF_COLORS).
---

<section class="hitbox-area" aria-labelledby="hitbox-area-title">
  <div class="hitbox-area-head">
    <h2 id="hitbox-area-title">Hitbox area</h2>
    <div class="hitbox-view-controls">
      <div
        id="hitbox-mode-buttons"
        class="hitbox-view-buttons"
        role="group"
        aria-label="Camera mode"
      >
        <button type="button" data-mode="3d" aria-pressed="true">3D</button>
        <button type="button" data-mode="2d" aria-pressed="false">2D</button>
      </div>
      <div
        id="hitbox-view-buttons"
        class="hitbox-view-buttons"
        role="group"
        aria-label="Camera side"
      >
        <button type="button" data-view="front" aria-pressed="false"
          >Front</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-view="back" aria-pressed="false">Back</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-view="left" aria-pressed="false">Left</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-view="right" aria-pressed="false"
          >Right</button
        >
        <button type="button" data-view="top" aria-pressed="false">Top</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="hitbox-compare" class="hitbox-compare" hidden>
    <div class="hitbox-compare-bar">
      <div
        id="hitbox-compare-headline"
        class="hitbox-headline"
        aria-label="Whole robot area change, A to B"
        aria-live="polite"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        id="hitbox-metric-buttons"
        class="hitbox-view-buttons"
        role="group"
        aria-label="Compared area"
      >
        <button type="button" data-metric="withWeapons" aria-pressed="true">
          With weapons
        </button>
        <button type="button" data-metric="alone" aria-pressed="false">
          Alone
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="hitbox-compare-legend">
      <span
        ><span class="hitbox-swatch" data-diff="shared"></span> Both builds</span
      >
      <span
        ><span class="hitbox-swatch" data-diff="aOnly"></span> Only A (lost)</span
      >
      <span
        ><span class="hitbox-swatch" data-diff="bOnly"></span> Only B (gained)</span
      >
    </p>
  </div>
  <div id="hitbox-area-pools" class="hitbox-area-pools" aria-live="polite">
    <p class="is-muted">Measuring...</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="hitbox-area-notes">
    <li>
      Projected hitbox area in m² as seen from each side, for the build above.
      The torso, each shoulder, and the chassis's pelvis, left leg and right leg
      are their own health pools (a spider's two left legs share one pool, as do
      its two right legs); a weapon's hits go to the part it is mounted on.
      Shoulders and legs are measured from their outer side only.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Alone</strong>: the part's own hitboxes. <strong
        >With weapons</strong
      >: the part plus its mounted weapons, overlap counted once. Each part is
      measured on its own, as if nothing else were in front of it.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Whole robot</strong>: every health pool combined into one
      silhouette, overlap counted once; so it is less than the pools added up.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>2D</strong> shows the hitboxes flat from the chosen side, in the same
      colors as the 3D view; in <strong>3D</strong> the side buttons aim the camera
      from that side.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Compare</strong> (next to Build): build B is build A plus the parts
      you swap; slots you leave alone follow A. Every view then shows where the silhouettes
      differ, and the headline gives the whole robot's change per side. A smaller
      area (green) is a harder target.
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .hitbox-compare {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hitbox-compare[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .hitbox-compare-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .hitbox-headline {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .hitbox-headline :global(.hitbox-headline-item) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: 4.5rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--wrf-border);
    border-radius: var(--wrf-radius-sm);
    background: var(--wrf-bg);
    color: var(--wrf-text);
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .hitbox-headline :global(.hitbox-headline-item.is-active) {
    border-color: var(--wrf-accent);
  }

  .hitbox-headline :global(.hitbox-headline-view) {
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hitbox-headline :global(.hitbox-headline-value) {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .hitbox-headline :global(.is-better .hitbox-headline-value),
  .hitbox-area-pools :global(td.is-better) {
    color: var(--wrf-success);
  }

  .hitbox-headline :global(.is-worse .hitbox-headline-value),
  .hitbox-area-pools :global(td.is-worse) {
    color: var(--wrf-danger);
  }

  .hitbox-headline :global(.is-same .hitbox-headline-value),
  .hitbox-area-pools :global(td.is-same) {
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
  }

  .hitbox-compare-legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .hitbox-compare-legend .hitbox-swatch {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .hitbox-area {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--wrf-border);
    border-radius: var(--wrf-radius-md);
    background: var(--wrf-surface);
  }

  .hitbox-area-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hitbox-area-head h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .hitbox-view-controls {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
  }

  .hitbox-view-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .hitbox-view-buttons button {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--wrf-border);
    border-radius: var(--wrf-radius-sm);
    background: var(--wrf-surface-2);
    color: var(--wrf-text);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .hitbox-view-buttons button:hover {
    border-color: var(--wrf-accent-hover);
  }

  .hitbox-view-buttons button[aria-pressed='true'] {
    border-color: var(--wrf-accent);
    background: var(--wrf-accent-active-bg);
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.is-muted) {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
  }

  /* Cards are created at runtime by area_panel.ts, hence :global. */
  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.hitbox-pool) {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--wrf-border);
    border-radius: var(--wrf-radius-sm);
    background: var(--wrf-bg);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  /* The whole-robot card spans its own row above the per-pool cards. */
  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.hitbox-pool-total) {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.hitbox-pool-total table) {
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(h3) {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.hitbox-pool-module),
  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.hitbox-pool-weapons) {
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
    font-weight: normal;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.hitbox-pool-weapons) {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0.4rem;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(.hitbox-swatch) {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(table) {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(th),
  .hitbox-area-pools :global(td) {
    padding: 0.2rem 0.35rem;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(thead th) {
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
    font-weight: normal;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--wrf-border);
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(th:first-child) {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(tbody th button) {
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(tbody th button:hover) {
    color: var(--wrf-link-hover);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(th.is-active button) {
    color: var(--wrf-accent);
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .hitbox-area-pools :global(td.is-muted) {
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
  }

  .hitbox-area-notes {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--wrf-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
</style>
